      "url": "https://healthymag.org/2026/07/10/intermittent-fasting-vs-calorie-counting/",
      "canonicalUrl": "https://healthymag.org/2026/07/10/intermittent-fasting-vs-calorie-counting",
      "title": "Intermittent Fasting vs. Counting Calories: A 2026 Study Says One May Be Easier to Stick To - HealthyMag",
